== Usage ==
=== Crafting ===
'''Refined Minerals''' can be used to craft a total of {{green|5}} items, requiring a total of {{Item|Refined Mineral|amount=33}}s.
{{Crafting Usage}}

=== Forging ===
'''Refined Minerals''' can also be used to forge a total of {{green|6}} items, requiring a total of {{Item|Refined Mineral|amount=128}}s. 
